{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-56","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","sourceIds":["event-rogue-56"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-56-talk-403815432-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-56","missionId":"event-rogue-56","mission":"쓰레기통 털기 마스터","scene":"쓰레기통 털기 마스터","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"쓰레기통을 멘 사람을 만났다. 그는 쭈그려 앉아 자신의 보물인 쓰레기통을 당신에게 보여줬다","talkId":403815432,"textHash":"12847355544722775761","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:56/talk-403815432","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"9e5459dae1a9fb69","bwikiNextIds":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-56-talk-403815433-line"],"bwikiPage":"掏垃圾桶大师","bwikiRevision":92650,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-10322","bwikiMission":"쓰레기통 털기 마스터"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-56-talk-403815433-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-56","missionId":"event-rogue-56","mission":"쓰레기통 털기 마스터","scene":"쓰레기통 털기 마스터","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「이건 신비로운 공간이야」 그는 손을 흔들곤 당신에게 공간을 내주기 위해 애절한 사랑 시를 꺼내서 버렸다","talkId":403815433,"textHash":"8028487459137968342","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:56/talk-403815433","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"9e5459dae1a9fb69","bwikiNextIds":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-56-talk-403815434-line"],"bwikiPage":"掏垃圾桶大师","bwikiRevision":92650,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-10322","bwikiMission":"쓰레기통 털기 마스터"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-56-talk-403815434-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-56","missionId":"event-rogue-56","mission":"쓰레기통 털기 마스터","scene":"쓰레기통 털기 마스터","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"그가 나지막이 말했다. 「너의 쓰레기를 안에 넣으면, 의식을 가진 물건으로 진화해 스스로 활기차게 뛰쳐나올 거야!」","talkId":403815434,"textHash":"2426756897108553866","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:56/talk-403815434","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"9e5459dae1a9fb69","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"掏垃圾桶大师","bwikiRevision":92650,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-10322","bwikiMission":"쓰레기통 털기 마스터"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-56-text-2296915825516864328-choice","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-56","missionId":"event-rogue-56","mission":"쓰레기통 털기 마스터","scene":"쓰레기통 털기 마스터","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"쓰레기에도 쓰레기만의 *의미*가 있다…","talkId":null,"textHash":"2296915825516864328","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:56/text-2296915825516864328","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"f66dea9139ccbd32","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"掏垃圾桶大师","bwikiRevision":92650,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-10322","bwikiMission":"쓰레기통 털기 마스터"}],"orderNote":"공식 사건 도감에 귀속된 한국어 원문입니다. BWIKI에서 확인한 모드별 구간만 연결하며 조건·확률·미확인 경계는 이어 붙이지 않습니다.","bwikiBaseOrder":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-56-talk-403815432-line","unknowable-domain-event-rogue-56-talk-403815433-line","unknowable-domain-event-rogue-56-talk-403815434-line","unknowable-domain-event-rogue-56-text-2296915825516864328-choice"],"bwiki":{"matchedRows":0,"cachedRows":4,"reviewRows":0,"segments":2,"reorderedRows":0},"retainedTextRowIds":[]}